  "ruleText": "Cla 201.01 “Adjudicative proceeding” means “adjudicative proceeding” as defined in RSA 541-A:1, I., namely “the procedure to be followed in contested cases, as set forth in RSA 541-A:31 through RSA 541-A: 36.”\n\nSource. #2659, eff 3-28-84; EXPIRED 3-28-90\n\nNew. #5481, eff 11-1-92, EXPIRED: 11-1-98\n\nNew. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
